<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues airstrikes and artillery against Hezbollah sites in southern Lebanon while occupying Haddatha under a cease-fire, and Hezbollah responds with guerrilla attacks and drone warfare. Lebanese President Aoun publicly demanded Israeli withdrawal and warned Iran to stop interfering in Lebanon’s affairs. An Israeli envoy sought to limit damage after stating US troops would only return when Iran is defeated. European states are advancing a plan to replace UN peacekeepers as UNIFIL prepares to exit, and the UN Security Council endorsed the mission without naming a successor. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPcTJBQkxNUXRZb0RUa3doanRkQVVUa2h5WExWZlljQlY0d3lVeVRRSE5MOGtZSU1oVlhJNEk4bGsyS2VqX0V4b0tIdkNVVmRrOFY0TWZib2JtdUxZbDVGMmRYWXd1QndQUC1kQ3BYT3YtQ2ZXSmFjdTR4Q3BTc2M1M3RWcjI1RUxIMWktMTJyZENxYlY1emc4QXlTVHlXMlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOVmF4dmxfdm9CQml4RExHbVgtSU5JZXZWcVRqbXItRFBublBkcHo0aGNQM0wtX05XeEZ2QVJfaVREeEJuVXBHX3U0TW11cEQ0dmlDSkthNGtIRmdnUFJ0UHRTRm9OT0JoQ2d4Q0N2cjVqUDlsZUVJZ1lDbXVPdnZmcllNOHRkcmZZaTFQVXdmZFVVdGd2eTFOSnZBMG1naTZKUnRGZ01sbTJPdEpYNEN4TTllQmJmaDlj0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBMVlpmMDUyNzl2SDhHcms1b2lYOGoyUGZuLTlZZm4zZGd2d2NPaWdxLUdXV1hLYTVRODdNU2hSRjE0MFAyZzB4bngwNk14THo3bEJiVjRqNnBWTmQxNlMzeFdmLTJvRkdpZTgzVXRMRWN5VC1iZnRYWjlMWlJFSXJFVldiSHVJYkxaSS1ITmZ6Y1R5ZWtraVlSRDRJaDZVMXRGazJGaG9CZjUyazJObUlUTWtWRGNNbThuYTVnWnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5lZUpxM2JnOUkyaWMtTjIwNGxMSVhVMVV